title: Zeigner Cabinet on the line!
subtitle: <span style="color: [+ ebert_colour +];">Ebert</span> calls on Zeigner to shuffle his cabinet in favour of the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> and ousting the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>
tags: event
is-card: true
priority: 1
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/portraits/ZeignerErich.jpg
view-if: freiberg_bloodbath_seen = 1 and saxony_gov == "Left"
new-page: true

= Zeigner Cabinet on the line!

<span style="color: [+ ebert_colour +];">Ebert</span> calls on Zeigner to shuffle his cabinet in favour of the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> and ousting the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>. <span style="color: [+ ebert_colour +];">Ebert</span> shows himself ready to make use of any means to remove the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> from power.

- @zeigner_refuses: Zeigner refuses.

@zeigner_refuses

Zeigner will not reshuffle his cabinet or betray the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>. The actions of the Reichswehr and by extention the national government and <span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> that stand behind reactionaries but not their own party are outraging on their own, Zeigner shows no interest in any appeal made by <span style="color: [+ ebert_colour +];">Ebert</span>...

- @killer_ebert: Then it will be a Reichsexekution...

@killer_ebert
on-arrival: thuringia_gov = "SPD"; saxony_gov = "SPD"; saxony_uspd = 2; saxony_kpd = 0

The government of Saxony has been deposed. A new prime minister must be elected.

- @spd_minority: Another <span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> minority government?
- @social_liberal: A coalition with the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> [? if spd_ddp_coalition_saxony < 50: and the <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span> ?]?
- @bourgeois_cabinet: We won't form another government.
- @do_nothing: The Reichskommisar has to rule a bit longer.

@spd_minority

- @get_kpd_toleration: Can we return to a government tolerated by the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>?
- @get_ddp_toleration: Maybe we should ask the the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> for their support now.
- @social_liberal: A coalition with the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> [? if spd_ddp_coalition_saxony < 50: and the <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span> ?]?
- @bourgeois_cabinet: We won't form another government.
- @do_nothing: The Reichskommisar has to rule a bit longer.

@get_kpd_toleration
subtitle: Our local branch preferes this option.
choose-if: kpd_relation >= 50 and left_strength >= 35
unavailable-subtitle: [? if kpd_relation < 50: The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> is not willing to tolerate another <span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> government now. ?][? if left_strength < 35: The opposition of our national party is to strong... ?]
on-arrival: saxony_gov = "SPD"; saxony_kpd = 2; saxony_pm = "Fleißner"; saxony_pm_party = "SPD"

Hermann Fleißner (<span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span>) is elected to be the new prime minister.

@get_ddp_toleration
subtitle: <span style="color: [+ ebert_colour +];">Ebert</span> would love this.
choose-if: ddp_relation >= 40 and spd_ddp_coalition_saxony >= 50
unavailable-subtitle: [? if  ddp_relation < 40: The <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> won't do this. ?][? if spd_ddp_coalition_saxony < 50: This could not achieve enough support in parliament. ?]
on-arrival: saxony_gov = "SPD"; saxony_ddp = 2; saxony_pm = "Fellisch"; saxony_pm_party = "SPD"

Alfred Fellisch (<span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span>) is elected to be the new prime minister.

@social_liberal
subtitle: This is our only hope for maintaining our rule of Saxony with a stable majority...
choose-if: ddp_relation >= 35 and (spd_ddp_coalition_saxony >= 50 or (early_dvp_cooperation >= 2 and dvp_relation >= 30)) 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if ddp_relation < 35: The <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> doesn't consider that option. ?][? if spd_ddp_coalition_saxony >= 50: A coalition between the spd_ddp_coalition_saxony >= 50 and us could not maintain any support. ?][? if early_dvp_cooperation < 2: Our party will not cooperate with the <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span>. ?][? if dvp_relation < 30: The <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span> doesn't want to work with us in the first place. ?]
on-arrival: saxony_gov = "Social-Liberal"; workers_spd -= 3; workers_kpd += 2; ddp_relation += 2; saxony_ddp = 1; saxony_dvp = 1 if spd_ddp_coalition_saxony < 50; kpd_relation -= 7 if spd_ddp_coalition_saxony < 50; workers_spd -= 2 if spd_ddp_coalition_saxony < 50; saxony_pm = "Heldt"; saxony_pm_party = "SPD"

Max Heldt (<span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span>) is elected to be the new prime minister. [? if spd_ddp_coalition_saxony >= 50: It appears the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> has abstained, the <span style="color: [+ dnvp_colour +];">**DNVP**</span> didn't attend the election at all. ?]

@bourgeois_cabinet
subtitle: This will result in a coalition of the liberal parties.
choose-if: bourgeois_coalition_saxony == 50
unavailable-subtitle: There is no possible arrangment without us
on-arrival: saxony_gov = "Bourgeois"; workers_spd -= 1; workers_kpd += 1; ddp_relation -= 2; saxony_spd = 0; saxony_ddp = 1; saxony_z = 1; saxony_dnvp = 2; saxony_dvp = 1; saxony_pm = "Kaiser"; saxony_pm_party = "DVP"

Friedrich Kaiser (<span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span>) is elected to be the new prime minister. His coalition depends on the support of the <span style="color: [+ dnvp_colour +];">**DNVP**</span>.

@do_nothing
on-arrival: saxony_spd = 0; saxony_dvp = 1; saxony_z = 2; saxony_dnvp = 2; saxony_ddp = 2; saxony_gov = "Bourgeois"; new_middle_spd -= 2; workers_spd -= 2; kpd_relation += 1; saxony_pm = "Heinze"; saxony_pm_party = "DVP"




  
